= Tractatus Logico-Philosophicus =
[: [[local:zz.texts/wittgenstein1922-tractatusLogicoPhilosophicus.pdf]]<br>
by [[wittgenstein]], published 1921 (German), 1922 (English) :]

====== short ======
The only work (other than notes) Wittgenstein produced in his early period.
May reasonably be viewed as the foundational work of Analytic Philosophy.
Only Russell's early works or Ayer's _Language Truth and Logic_ might surpass
its influence on analytic philosophers. 

The work's central task is the exposition of Wittgenstein's (unsayable) account
of modality and our knowledge of necessary truths.

